<title>USA: Del. $30 mln mortgage bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Del. $30 mln mortgage bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Delaware Economic Development Authority's $30 million mortgage revenue bond deal, lowering yields. The top yield at the repricing was cut to approximately 6.431 percent from 6.50 percent in 2022.</p>
